.TH G15-FANCONTROLD 1 "2026-07-26" "g15-fanctl 0.1.0" "Dell G15 Fan Control Center"
.SH NAME
g15-fancontrold \- fan/thermal management daemon for the Dell G15 5530
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B g15-fancontrold
.SH DESCRIPTION
System service that monitors CPU/GPU temperature, fan RPM, and utilization,
and applies thermal profiles or manual fan curves where the firmware
supports it. Exposes a D-Bus API on the system bus at
.B org.g15fanctl.Daemon
for the GUI and CLI to use. Normally started and supervised by systemd via
the
.B g15-fancontrold.service
unit rather than run directly.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Controls log verbosity (e.g. \fBdebug\fR, \fBinfo\fR, \fBwarn\fR). Defaults to \fBinfo\fR.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/g15-fanctl/state.json
Persisted active profile and saved fan curves, restored on daemon startup.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR g15fanctl (1),
.BR systemctl (1)
